# >>> GANDYR-GITIGNORE-BASELINE:BEGIN
# Baseline comum Gandyr (DA-029).
# Fontes: VisualStudio.gitignore (GitHub/Microsoft) + Node + Python + OS + secrets.
# Merge idempotente: preserve regras especificas do projeto FORA deste bloco.
# NAO ignore: AGENTS.md, AI-CONTEXT.md, .docs/, .cursor/, .claude/, .githooks/,
#             CHANGELOG.md, BACKLOG.md, Architecture.md (modo LEGADO).
# Encoding: ASCII-safe sem acento e sem BOM (ADR-000 D2).

############################################################
